        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/2c79bf4e286086caed73efad602af19e.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/310cdb44fad28ca78e0eef374f1e5f59.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as the rebellious group known as R.O.A.R against various other factions such as the NEDF cyborg army, evil spirits, robots, and other grotesque monsters. Use your powerful gun to destroy and neutralize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/6e805b71eb881698e776a4a38ef7e7ea.poster.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/6e805b71eb881698e776a4a38ef7e7ea.webm?t=1764023582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/6e805b71eb881698e776a4a38ef7e7ea.mp4?t=1764023582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/e3fb0b0eb4c6a56b3563eea36c32fe2f.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place after the 5th World War, after the invasion of an alien race controlling Earth and establishing the NEDF. after many losses on Earth, the rebellious guerilla group known as R.O.A.R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decides to take the fight to the enemy. The agents of Roar will have to battle the NEDF cyborgs, mechanical titans, and grotesque monsters to attack the enemy at its heart and destroy the main portal while</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >spilling cyborg blood for a better future for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/e8e929e83612ae72e0152ba791fc754c.poster.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/e8e929e83612ae72e0152ba791fc754c.webm?t=1764023582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/e8e929e83612ae72e0152ba791fc754c.mp4?t=1764023582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/87526709e672a025b9cbfbb0b3a41402.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 5 action-packed challenging levels in this action-packed game, each level is different with various enemies specific to that level, and many many bosses. your arsenal includes your basic machine gun and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an overcharge ability that upgrades your weapon for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000040/extras/d3e1e6649fd3e118c12aafcb987f8cd5.poster.avif?t=1764023582\" width=616 heig